  "instructions": [
    "Heat ghee in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add chopped green chili and saute for a minute.",
    "Add coriander powder and garam masala and cook for another minute.",
    "Add spinach puree, dark soy sauce, salt, and pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add paneer cubes and stir gently to combine with the spinach mixture.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let it simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir occasionally to prevent the paneer from sticking to the bottom of the pan.",
    "Serve hot with naan or rice."
